[00:00.00]Tyron Hapi、Bianca - Lost Control
[00:15.55]The trees were weeping in the evenings
[00:20.19]Where we used to pass them by
[00:22.96]The air was cold without that feeling
[00:27.53]Of you there by my side
[00:30.55]I try to hear the words that you'd say
[00:34.04]The light you gave me isn't there
